          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this model is destroyed, roll on D6 before removing it from play. On a 4+ it explodes, and each unit (excluding NURGLE units) within 6&quot; suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
