          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model has a transport capacity of 10 &lt;LEGION&gt; INFANTRY models. Each JUMP PACK or TERMINATOR takes up the space of 2 models and each CULT OF DESTRUCTION model takes up the space of 3 models. Each POSSESSED models takes up the space of 2 models.</characteristic>
