          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">The Chaos Thunderhawk Gunship haas a transport capacity of 30 &lt;LEGION&gt; INFANTRY  or &lt;LEGION&gt; BIKER models. Each JUMP PACK or TERMINATOR model takes up the space of 2 models, and each BIKER or CULT OF DESTRUCTION model takes up the space of 3 models. Each POSSESSED models takes up the space of 2 models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
