                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, after the bearer has moved, you can select one unit the bearer moved across. Roll six D6s for each VEHICLE or MONSTER model in that unit and roll one D6 for each other model in that unit (to a maximum of 18): for each 4+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
